[Rogue quest spoilers]




















There are no doors that lead to all of the chambers of the bottom level
of the rogue's quest.  To reach the boss, you must either polymorph
yourself into something that phases (like a Xorn), or you must fall through
trapdoors from the level above, repeatedly, until you land in the right
chamber (and use level teleportation to escape).  It's nasty but true.
I much prefer the self-poly solution:  self-poly to Xorn, walk in,
fire off the wand of death, grab artifacts and bail out. :)




